{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-94  Back-to-back berth bookings are rejected\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: berths   reported: 2026-08-18 by berth-planning\n\nPlanners cannot book a vessel onto a berth at the exact time the previous vessel leaves\nit. A booking that ends at noon and the next one starting at noon do not overlap, but\nthe schedule reports a clash.\n\nAcceptance:\n  The book method of BerthSchedule accepts a booking that starts exactly when another\n  booking on the same berth ends (and one that ends exactly when another starts); bookings\n  that genuinely overlap on the same berth are still refused.\n\nFiles:\n  src/berths/schedule.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_0199RbvaztcMYWnaa7pK9PGB", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "49fd7b86-4e8f-47e5-af24-554cbe370d71", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:35.333Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-94  Back-to-back berth bookings are rejected\nstatus: open   priority: P2   area: berths   reported: 2026-08-18 by berth-planning\n\nPlanners cannot book a vessel onto a berth at the exact time the previous vessel leaves\nit. A booking that ends at noon and the next one starting at noon do not overlap, but\nthe schedule reports a clash.\n\nAcceptance:\n  The book method of BerthSchedule accepts a booking that starts exactly when another\n  booking on the same berth ends (and one that ends exactly when another starts); bookings\n  that genuinely overlap on the same berth are still refused.\n\nFiles:\n  src/berths/schedule.ts"}, "type": "user"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"id": "toolu_01QHFV2EMmf9ocnSEgCfiMzp", "input": {"file_path": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch/src/berths/schedule.ts"}, "name": "Read", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9H2daxDEGaZup3ajPt", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "49fd7b86-4e8f-47e5-af24-554cbe370d71", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:37.463Z", "type": "assistant"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "1\timport type { Booking } from \"@harbor/dispatch/types\";\n2\t\n3\tfunction overlaps(a: Booking, b: Booking): boolean {\n4\t  return a.start.getTime() <= b.end.getTime() && b.start.getTime() <= a.end.getTime();\n5\t}\n6\t\n7\texport class BerthSchedule {\n8\t  #bookings: Booking[] = [];\n9\t\n10\t  book(booking: Booking): void {\n11\t    if (booking.end.getTime() <= booking.start.getTime()) {\n12\t      throw new RangeError(\"a booking must end after it starts\");\n13\t    }\n14\t    const clash = this.#bookings.find((b) => b.berth === booking.berth && overlaps(b, booking));\n15\t    if (clash) {\n16\t      throw new Error(`berth ${booking.berth} is already booked for ${clash.vessel}`);\n17\t    }\n18\t    this.#bookings.push(booking);\n19\t  }\n20\t\n21\t  bookingsFor(berth: string): Booking[] {\n22\t    return this.#bookings\n23\t      .filter((b) => b.berth === berth)\n24\t      .sort((a, b) => a.start.getTime() - b.start.getTime());\n25\t  }\n26\t}\n27\t", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01QHFV2EMmf9ocnSEgCfiMzp", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "49fd7b86-4e8f-47e5-af24-554cbe370d71", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:37.487Z", "toolUseResult": {}, "type": "user"}
{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/eval-INC-94-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"text": "Now I can see the issue! The `overlaps` function uses `<=` comparisons, which treats bookings that touch at their endpoints as overlapping. For example, a booking ending at noon and another starting at noon should be allowed (no actual overlap), but the current logic rejects them.\n\nThe fix is to use strict `<` comparisons instead of `<=`:", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9HBuwEsvM1bmoo7sb7", "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "49fd7b86-4e8f-47e5-af24-554cbe370d71", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:40:42.457Z", "type": "assistant"}
